<title>PORTUGAL: Share trade halted in Proholding. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</title>
<headline>Share trade halted in Proholding. [CORRECTED 16:40 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to remove reference to Sonae, which does not own Proholding as originally stated)</p>
<p>Portugal's Financial Markets Committee (CMVM) ordered the suspension of trade in shares of Proholding, a bourse spokesman said.</p>
<p>He gave no reason for the suspension of the chemical company.</p>
</text>
